flowchart TD
    A[Client Intake Form] --> B{Valid fields?}
    B -->|No| B1[Reject with message and log]
    B -->|Yes| C{Email already a client?}
    C -->|Yes| C1[Log duplicate and notify staff]
    C -->|No| D[Create client, checklist and tasks<br/>status: awaiting_documents]
    D --> E[Welcome email]
    E --> F[Event Log]
    B1 --> F
    C1 --> F

    G[Daily Schedule] --> H[Find clients awaiting documents]
    H --> I{"Days since intake past threshold<br/>and step not yet done?"}
    I -->|Reminder 1| J[Send reminder and record it]
    I -->|Reminder 2| K[Send reminder and record it]
    I -->|Escalation| L[Alert staff, status: escalated]
    J --> F
    K --> F
    L --> F

    M[Document Upload Form] --> N{Known client and valid file?}
    N -->|No| N1[Reject with message]
    N -->|Yes| O[Update checklist]
    N1 --> F
    O --> P{All documents received?}
    P -->|No| Q[Keep pending]
    P -->|Yes| R[Status: ready]
    R --> S[Notify staff]
    Q --> F
    S --> F

    B -. Errors .-> T[Shared Error Handler]
    H -. Errors .-> T
    N -. Errors .-> T
